{"parse": {"title": "流行于世界-06", "pageid": 147081, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B5%81%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%8E%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C-05\" title=\"流行于世界-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">流行于世界-06</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">流行于世界</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.96.B0.E6.B5.81.E8.A1.8C.E7.9A.84.E8.AF.9E.E7.94.9F\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"新流行的诞生\">新流行的诞生</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 新流行的诞生</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\"></div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"no-indent\">\n<div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_3054_level_8.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory 3054 level 8.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/Rolestory_3054_level_8.png/200px-Rolestory_3054_level_8.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"133\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/Rolestory_3054_level_8.png/300px-Rolestory_3054_level_8.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/Rolestory_3054_level_8.png/400px-Rolestory_3054_level_8.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"600\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></div></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"border: 1px solid; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 5px; display: inline-block; text-align: center; height: 20px; line-height: 18px; min-width: &#91;&#91;:模板:Width&#93;&#93;; color: #666; padding: 0 5px;\">13:16 洋葱头的家</span></div>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:V3a1_rolestory_pic_10.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory pic 10.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/V3a1_rolestory_pic_10.png/110px-V3a1_rolestory_pic_10.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"119\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/V3a1_rolestory_pic_10.png/165px-V3a1_rolestory_pic_10.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/V3a1_rolestory_pic_10.png/220px-V3a1_rolestory_pic_10.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"482\" data-file-height=\"520\" /></a><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory game placebg.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png/400px-V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"41\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"588\" data-file-height=\"60\" />\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); white-space: nowrap;\"><img alt=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/15px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/23px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"24\" data-file-height=\"28\" /><span style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 14px;margin-left: 20px; color: #cccccc\">洋葱头的家</span></div>\n</div><br />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洋葱头：</b></span>“呼……呼……”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>即使已经回到了家里，记者依然有些惊魂未定。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洋葱头：</b></span>“这不是一个美妙的回忆，但好在事情结束得很顺利……接下来，我需要把这篇报道写出来。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洋葱头：</b></span>“关于‘麦田怪圈’、未知飞行物以及基金会的内幕……”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洋葱头：</b></span>“但是……”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>“麦田怪圈”已被恢复原状；未知飞行物销声匿迹，目击者已被抹去记忆；基金会的议题尚未成熟，贸然揭露只会引起麻烦。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洋葱头：</b></span>“唯一可报道的内容是，奶牛制造甲烷是为了加强大气层防卫……我敢打赌台长不喜欢这个议题，除非那头奶牛能够立刻成为一名当红明星。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洋葱头：</b></span>“至于其他的……”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>电话：</b></span>“叮铃铃——”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>响铃打断了她的思维。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洋葱头：</b></span>“您好，这里是洋葱头。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>台长：</b></span>“洋葱头，把你关于《Headonion》的立项报告拿上，立刻来我办公室。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>台长：</b></span>“我有话要和你说。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory game placebg.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png/400px-V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"41\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"588\" data-file-height=\"60\" />\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); white-space: nowrap;\"><img alt=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/15px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/23px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"24\" data-file-height=\"28\" /><span style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 14px;margin-left: 20px; color: #cccccc\">电视台·办公室</span></div>\n</div><br />\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_madierda_pic_17.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory madierda pic 17.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/Rolestory_madierda_pic_17.png/110px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_17.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"104\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/Rolestory_madierda_pic_17.png/165px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_17.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/Rolestory_madierda_pic_17.png/220px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_17.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"470\" data-file-height=\"444\" /></a><br />\n台长坐在那张柔软的皮椅上，正翻看着《Headonion》的立项报告。<br />\n<small style=\"color: #999;\">点击打开</small><br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>台长：</b></span>“报告通过了。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>这个消息过于不可思议，以至于记者无法相信自己的耳朵。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洋葱头：</b></span>“您可以再重复一遍吗，台长先生？”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>台长清了清嗓子。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>台长：</b></span>“刚刚我们收到了一笔来源于圣洛夫基金会的赞助——他们点名要赞助《Headonion》的播出。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洋葱头：</b></span>“圣洛夫基金会？！”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>台长：</b></span>“他们给了一笔不菲的金额，让人很难拒绝。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>台长：</b></span>“刚刚我们结束了相关会议，很遗憾地通知你——洋葱头小姐，你的《Headonion》已成功立项。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>台长：</b></span>“不过，为了电视台的声誉考虑，我们只能将这个节目划分为娱乐节目。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>台长：</b></span>“如果你无法接受这一点……”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>还没等台长说完话，记者立刻打断了他。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洋葱头：</b></span>“我接受！台长先生！只要能够让《Headonion》顺利播出，我什么都可以接受！”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>台长略带诧异地看向她。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>台长：</b></span>“是吗？以你对娱乐节目的讨厌程度，我还以为你会拒绝它。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洋葱头：</b></span>“台长，当然，我不喜欢娱乐节目——但现在，显然有比我个人好恶更加重要的事情！”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洋葱头：</b></span>“我需要足够的影响力，让观众明白这个世界都在发生些什么！未知生物的入侵、消失的奶牛、温室效应的真相……”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洋葱头：</b></span>“还有基金会里的孩子……他们需要一个人来帮助他们发声！”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洋葱头：</b></span>“但为什么基金会要赞助《Headonion》……”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>台长：</b></span>“我也很好奇，为什么有人会对这个节目感兴趣？”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>片刻的思考之后，记者恍然大悟。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洋葱头：</b></span>“封口费！”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洋葱头：</b></span>“我明白了，台长！基金会不希望我说出那些真相，所以他们干脆赞助了《Headonion》。这样他们就能够更大程度地去把控节目的内容……”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>台长：</b></span>“据我所知，圣洛夫基金会并没有对节目内容提出特别的要求。他们很欣赏你关于未知飞行物的观点。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>台长：</b></span>“这也正是我最想不通的地方。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洋葱头：</b></span>“……”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>记者面色凝重。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洋葱头：</b></span>“他们远比我想象的更危险。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洋葱头：</b></span>“我唯一的使命就是把真相带到观众的面前，虽然我不希望大家误解它——但只要有机会，我必须选择抓住，也只能抓住。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洋葱头：</b></span>“我相信观众的判断力——他们当然能分辨出什么是真的、什么是假的。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>台长：</b></span>“……”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>台长：</b></span>“是吗？那么恭喜你，洋葱头小姐。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>台长耸了耸肩，向洋葱头伸出手。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>台长：</b></span>“合作愉快。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>记者牢牢握住了那双手。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洋葱头：</b></span>“合作愉快，台长，相信我们很快就能把《Headonion》带到观众的眼前！”<br /></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "流行于世界-06"}}